==Portuguese==

===Etymology===
{{etyl|ML.|pt}} {{term|cridare|crīdāre|to cry out, publish, proclaim|lang=pt}}, of uncertain origin. Perhaps from {{etyl|la|pt}} {{term|quiritare||to shriek, wail|lang=la}} (--Diez), or from {{etyl|frk|pt}} {{recons|kritan|krītan|to cry out, scream, proclaim|lang=frk}} (--Littré), compare {{etyl|dum|-}} {{term|critan|crītan|to cry|lang=dum}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|Portugal}} {{IPA|/gɾi.ˈtaɾ/|lang=pt}}
* {{a|Portugal|following an oral sound}} {{IPA|[ɣɾi.ˈtaɾ]|lang=pt}}

