==Spanish==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|osp|es}} {{term|cridar|cridar, gridar||lang=osp}}, from {{etyl|ML.|es}} {{term|cridare|crīdāre|to cry out, publish, proclaim|lang=la}}, of uncertain origin. Perhaps from {{etyl|la|es}} ''[[quiritare]]'' "to shriek, wail" (--Diez), or from {{etyl|frk|es}} *{{term||krītan||lang=frk}} "to cry out, scream, proclaim" (--Littré), compare {{etyl|dum|-}} {{term|critan|crītan|to cry|lang=dum}}.

===Verb===
{{es-verb|grit|ar}}

# to [[shout]], to [[scream]], to [[cry]] out, to [[call out]]
# to [[jeer]] at

